      "content": "\"How do I style <li>?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Developers ask:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "\"How do I style the list items inside the header?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "That question leads directly to practical selectors."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Typical Header Menu Structure (Conceptual)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
